      "type": "text"
    },
    {
      "topLeftX": 91,
      "topLeftY": 234,
      "bottomRightX": 628,
      "bottomRightY": 464,
      "content": "|  Bit offset (lsb << x) | Width (bits) | Description  |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n|  0 | 1 | Acknowledge Flag- Set this bit to 0 if the command_id belongs to a command- Set this bit to 1 if the command_id is used for an acknowledgement  |\n|  1 | 14 | Command ValueNumber identifying a single command/acknowledge  |\n|  15 | 1 | Custom Command Identifier- Set this bit to 0 to identify a standardized command value- Set this bit to 1 to mark a custom command value  |",
      "confidenceScores": null,
      "type": "table",
      "tableId": null
    },
    {
